&lt;img alt="0101010_007.jpg" src="images/0101010_007.jpg" style="height: 277.25px; width: 412.98px"/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfBusinessTextBlock>
